{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>And all that which is done for them</b> — as Onkelos renders: 'all that is handed over to them,' to the sons of Gershon. This is the language of Rashi (Rashi on Numbers 4:26). If so, <b>ye'aseh</b> is like 'and a man in Maon, and his ma'aseh in Carmel' (I Samuel 25:2) — his possessions that he works with. But the more correct reading is: all that is made for them for the Tabernacle and for the altar, for they have many vessels."], :book :numbers, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T04:02:35.234345202Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}